      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have a couple more information for this. It's not limited to Groups Activity.\n\nI think I know how it happens (had no time to test it yet):\n\n* Have a long list of Freinds who are online or a lot of open group instances\n\n* Scroll down in your list all the way\n\n* close menu\n\n* wait some time until many left VRChat or many group instances got closed\n\n* open up your menu again. \n\nWorkaround: Scrolling (if you can scroll) up fixes it",
